[4461]="700173D4\n1\tSpeak with Gelirwen at Echad Mirobel\030Collect Order from Dunland (quantity: see journal)\tEchad Mirobel is in the south-western stretches of Eregion. You have found strange orders pertaining to the ransack of the School of Tham Mirdain, and a champion of the Dunlendings who will lead this assault on the lore-vault of the Elves. You should bring this message to Echad Mirobel, where someone will hopefully know what to make of it.\n",
[4462]="70027709\n1\tDefeat Dunlending patrols (total: 4)\tDunlending outriders are patrolling the road along the Isen, south-west of the Rohirrim encampment. Grimbold has asked you to eliminate some of the Dunlending patrols in order to give the Rohirrim room to manoeuvre unseen.\n2\tTalk to Grimbold at the Ford of Isen\tGrimbold is at the Ford of Isen. You should inform Grimbold that the Dunlending patrols have been eliminated.\n",
[4463]="700278AA\n1\tTalk to Edhow in Lhan Rhos\tEdhow is in Lhan Rhos, at the centre of the Dunbog. Gwin the Avanc-hunter has asked you to return to Lhan Rhos and fetch him a new sword from Edhow.\n2\tTalk to Gwin in the Dunbog\tGwin can be found under the tree outside Lhan Rhos. Edhow asked you to tell Gwin that he will not provide him another sword.\n",
[4464]="7005A2E3\n1\tComplete 'Discovery: The Fall of Khazad-dûm'\tDáin has asked you to go to the East Gate of Moria and feel the presence of the Balrog within.\n2\tTalk to Dáin\tYou should return to Dáin and inform him that you did indeed feel the presence of the Balrog inside the gates of Moria.\n3\tSit and listen to Dáin's story\tSit before Dáin and listen to the story of Nafni the Unslain.\n4\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin has begun to tell the story of Nafni the Unslain. You should talk to Dáin to hear his story.\n5\tComplete 'The Fall of Khazad-dûm'\tComplete 'The Fall of Khazad-dûm' on any difficulty. Use the Instance Finder to enter this instance.\n6\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin has just about finished his story. You should talk to Dáin to hear the ending.\n",
[4465]="7004EB1B\n1\tExamine the stone\tThe sun is about to shine on a dwarf-wrought stone, which stands before the old secret door up on the side of Mount Erebor. You should step forward and see what becomes of the stone when the dying sun lights its face.\n2\tExamine the stone\tThe sun is about to shine on a dwarf-wrought stone, which stands before the old secret door up on the side of Mount Erebor. You should step forward and see what becomes of the stone when the dying sun lights its face.\n3\tExamine the stone\tYou have read the runes inscribed on the stone by Erebor's old side door.\n",
[4466]="7004A9D8\n1\tGather gems\tGather gems.\n2\tGather gems (total: 8)\tGather gems.\n3\tBring the gems to the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor\tA collection box can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor. Bring the gems to the Hall Under the Mountain.\n",
[4467]="7004A9EA\n1\tDefeat Uruks\tDefeat Uruks.\n2\tDefeat Uruks (total: 15)\tDefeat Uruks.\n3\tTalk to Candúr\tTalk to Candúr.\n",
[4468]="7004A38D\n1\tDefeat Mordor Warriors in Durthang (total: 10)\030Defeat Mordor Archers in Durthang (total: 10)\tDefeat Orc Guards throughout Durthang in Udûn.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many Orc Guards.\n",
[4469]="7004A9EB\n1\tCollect orders\tCollect orders.\n2\tCollect orders (total: 8)\tCollect orders.\n3\tBring the orders to Candúr\tBring the orders to Candúr.\n",
[4470]="7004A38C\n1\tSearch ornate coffers (total: 12)\tRansack the ornate cofffers throughout Durthang, in Udûn.\n2\tCompleted\tSearched many ornate coffers in Durthang.\n",
[4471]="7004A395\n1\tBreak sorcerer's baubles (total: 10)\tFind and break any Sorcerer's baubles you can find in Durthang, in Udûn.\n2\tCompleted\tBroke many sorcerer's baubles.\n",
[4472]="7004A39D\n1\tDefeat Uruk Enforcers (total: 5)\030Defeat Sorcerers (total: 5)\tDefeat Uruk Enforcers and Black Númenórean Sorcerers in Durthang, in Udûn.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many enforcers and sorcerers.\n",
[4473]="7004A9ED\n1\tDefeat Azgazôr\tDefeat Azgazôr.\n2\tTalk to Candúr\tYou should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.\n",
[4474]="7004ABCC\n1\tDefeat Dâurazar Drear-star\030Defeat Khilnazt the Silencer\030Defeat Magtárb the Furious\tDefeat Magtárb the Furious, Dâurazar Drear-star, and Khilnazt the Silencer in Durthang, in Udûn.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated Ugrukhôr's three trusted lieutenants.\n",
[4475]="7000C38D\n1\tTalk to Glóin at his camp in the Misty Mountains\tSeek out Glóin at his camp in the western foothills of the Misty Mountains, north of Rivendell, far to the east of Ered Luin. Dwalin wants you to bring word of warning to his friend Glóin in the Misty Mountains. He believes that the increased goblin activity may not be restricted to the goblins in Ered Luin.\n",
[4476]="70009A58\n1\tCollect the satchel of glassblowing tools\tThe satchel of glassblowing tools can be found on the stoop of a hobbit-hole on the north side of Dwaling. Hob Hillbrow has asked you to collect a satchel of glassblowing tools for him.\n2\tBring the satchel of glassblowing tools to Hob Hillbrow\tHob Hillbrow is at his home at the Bullroarer's Sward in Dwaling, south of the Sand-marshes. You should return to Hob Hillbrow with the satchel of glassblowing tools.\n",
[4477]="7001BFA2\n1\tDefeat Angár Irongut\tThe leader of the Dourhands might be found within Iorvinas. Logi has asked you to hunt down and defeat the leader of the Dourhands, who is trying to form an alliance with the Orcs.\n2\tTalk to Logi at the entrance to Iorvinas\tLogi is at the entrance to the ruins of Iorvinas. Defeating the leader of the Dourhands proved a relatively simple feat. With the leader defeated, the Dourhands will likely prove no more difficulty here.\n",
[4478]="70008762\n1\tReturn the beards to Fim the Worm at Dâr-gazag\030Collect dwarf-beards (total: 8)\tDwarves encroaching throughout the Ettenmoors wear full beards on their faces. The goblins believe that the beards are a matter of pride amongst the dwarves and want you to help them humiliate their hated foes. Fim the Worm bade you strip the beards of the dwarves in return for favour from the Snowreap.\n",
[4479]="70033030\n1\tFree dwarf captives in the Uzbad-bakân kitchens\tDwarf-captives can be found in the kitchen area of Uzbad-bakân in southern Zelem-melek. You should free dwarf-captives before the Orcs can cook them into dinner.\n2\tDwarf-captives can be found in the kitchen area of Uzbad-bakân in southern Zelem-melek. You should free dwarf-captives before the Orcs can cook them into dinner.\t\n3\tCompleted\tYou have freed the dwarves who were about to become meals to some slavering Orcs in Uzbad-bakân.\n",
[4480]="70050DAD\n1\tSpeak to Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth.\n",
